# Live CAHQ Working Set JSON. The browser GETs this URL with no credentials.
# Leave empty to use the committed sample fixture (no network).
#
# On a machine joined to the tailnet (Tailscale MagicDNS), the host is:
#   https://working-set.tail21f530.ts.net
# Point this variable at that origin when it returns JSON, or at the JSON
# path the Working Set UI actually calls. The cloud VM cannot resolve
# *.tail21f530.ts.net — do not treat a failed fetch as a live map.
# VITE_WORKING_SET_URL=https://working-set.tail21f530.ts.net
VITE_WORKING_SET_URL=
